t"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so its unique users are sessions. The session is also sent as ","type":"text"},{"code":"$session_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which PostHog’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sessions and web analytics group events by (","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the UUIDv7 they require); a record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with no session has none. The record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context value, aren’t sent.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property whose name starts with ","type":"text"},{"code":"$","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which only a hand-written ","type":"text"},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformance can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"write, or is ","type":"text"},{"code":"distinct_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is left out and logged at notice level, as PostHog reads those","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names as settings (","type":"text"},{"code":"$set","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"$process_person_profile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") or the identity.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"properties"},{"type":"text","text":" also holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Holds","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$app_namespace"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$app_version"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$app_build"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ApplicationKey","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The bundle identifier, version and build, each left out when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"$device_model","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"$device_type","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DeviceKey","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The model, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tablet"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Desktop"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TV"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Vision"},{"type":"text","text":" for the form factor; no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$device_type"},{"type":"text","text":" for a watch"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$locale"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LocaleKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The locale’s BCP 47 identif